# Smoke test of the runner (not a spec): pinyin typed after some text is marked, Space puts the first candidate in.
NAME     pinyin is marked, then Space puts the first candidate in after the text
PROFILES all
LANG     chinese
TEXT     "Hi Bob|"
TYPE     nihao
EXPECT   marked "nihao"
EXPECT   panel shown
KEY      space
EXPECT   doc "Hi Bob你好|"
EXPECT   marked none
EXPECT   panel hidden
EXPECT   lang chinese
EXPECT   nolost
